      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOT A MARK (1) was out of placings last time (18.76) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fifth and beaten 7 lengths. Looks well placed and should feature. WINNING HAND (7) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 5 lengths at Temora in a handy 18.92 beating Edge Of Faith. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from seven starts. Bold showing expected again. PHOENIX UMBRELLA (4) turned in a plain effort last time when sixth at this track over 320m behind Tommy's Ava (18.90) in a Grade 4/5. Expected to give a good account. AUSSIE RUSH (8) should be thereabouts.",
